### Koffy API - Coffees Endpoints
### Coffees can be created within roasters and viewed publicly
### Make sure to replace {{token}} with your actual JWT token

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@roasterId = 9
@coffeeId = 1
@categoryId = 7

### 1. Get all coffees (PUBLIC - shows active coffees from active roasters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees

### 2. Get all coffees (authenticated - shows more details for members)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get coffees filtered by roaster
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?roaster_id={{roasterId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get coffees filtered by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?category_id={{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get only featured coffees
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?featured=true

### 6. Get coffees by origin country
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?country=Colombia
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get coffees by roast level
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?roast_level=medium
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get coffees by process method
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?process_method=washed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get coffees with variants included
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?include_variants=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Complex filter - Colombian washed medium roast
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?country=Colombia&process_method=washed&roast_level=medium
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Pagination - Get first page (default: 20 items per page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Pagination - Get second page
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?page=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Pagination - Custom items per page (10 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?page=1&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Pagination - Large page size (50 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Pagination with filters - Featured coffees, page 1, 15 per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?featured=true&page=1&per_page=15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Pagination with filters - Colombian coffees, page 2, 25 per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?country=Colombia&page=2&per_page=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Pagination with multiple filters - Medium roast, page 1, 30 per page
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees?roast_level=medium&page=1&per_page=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Get a specific coffee by ID (PUBLIC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}

### 19. Get a specific coffee with authentication (more details)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Get coffee without variants
GET {{baseUrl}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}?include_variants=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21. Create a new coffee (MEMBERS ONLY - requires edit privileges)
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/coffees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffee": {
    "name": "Colombia Finca El Paraíso",
    "description": "Un café excepcional de la región de Cauca, con notas brillantes de frutas tropicales y un dulzor natural que recuerda a la panela.",
    "origin_country": "Colombia",
    "varietal": "Castillo, Caturra",
    "process_method": "washed",
    "roast_level": "medium",
    "flavor_notes": "Frutas tropicales, panela, cacao",
    "is_active": true,
    "featured": false,
    "category_ids": [1, 2]
  }
}

