### 25. Update a coffee (MEMBERS ONLY - requires edit privileges)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffee": {
    "name": "Colombia Finca El Paraíso - Edición Especial",
    "description": "Un café excepcional de la región de Cauca. Cosecha limitada 2024.",
    "flavor_notes": "Frutas tropicales, panela, cacao, cítricos",
    "featured": true
  }
}

### 26. Mark coffee as featured
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffee": {
    "featured": true
  }
}

### 27. Deactivate a coffee (keep it but hide from public)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffee": {
    "is_active": false
  }
}

### 28. Update coffee categories
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "coffee": {
    "category_ids": [1, 2, 3]
  }
}

### 29. Delete a coffee (MEMBERS ONLY - requires management privileges)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/roasters/{{roasterId}}/coffees/{{coffeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Pagination:
### The index endpoint supports pagination with the following query parameters:
### - page: Page number (default: 1)
### - per_page: Items per page (default: 20, maximum: 100)
###
### Example: GET /coffees?page=2&per_page=25
###
### Response includes pagination metadata:
### {
###   "data": [...],  // Array of coffee objects
###   "meta": {
###     "pagination": {
###       "current_page": 1,      // Current page number
###       "per_page": 20,          // Items per page
###       "total_pages": 5,        // Total number of pages
###       "total_count": 100,      // Total number of coffees
###       "next_page": 2,          // Next page number (null if last page)
###       "prev_page": null,       // Previous page number (null if first page)
###       "first_page": true,      // Is this the first page?
###       "last_page": false       // Is this the last page?
###     }
###   }
### }
###
### Coffee Fields:
### - name: String (required) - Name of the coffee
### - description: Text - Detailed description
### - origin_country: String - Country of origin (e.g., "Colombia", "Ethiopia")
### - varietal: String - Coffee varieties (e.g., "Caturra, Castillo")
### - process_method: String - Processing method
### - roast_level: String - Roast level
### - flavor_notes: String - Tasting notes
### - is_active: Boolean - Whether the coffee is visible to public
### - featured: Boolean - Whether to highlight this coffee
### - category_ids: Array - IDs of categories this coffee belongs to
###

### Process Methods:
### - washed: Lavado (clean, bright acidity)
### - natural: Natural/Seco (fruity, full body)
### - honey: Honey/Miel (sweet, balanced)
### - semi_washed: Semi-lavado
### - wet_hulled: Wet-hulled/Giling Basah
### - anaerobic: Fermentación anaeróbica

### Roast Levels:
### - light: Tueste claro (bright, acidic, complex)
### - medium_light: Tueste medio-claro
### - medium: Tueste medio (balanced)
### - medium_dark: Tueste medio-oscuro
### - dark: Tueste oscuro (bold, low acidity)

### Common Origin Countries:
### - Colombia, Ethiopia, Brazil, Costa Rica, Kenya, Guatemala,
### - Honduras, Peru, Rwanda, Panama, Indonesia, Yemen, etc.

### Permission Requirements:
### Action                | Public | Member | Barista | Manager | Owner
### ---------------------|--------|--------|---------|---------|-------
### List coffees         |   ✓*   |   ✓    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### View coffee          |   ✓*   |   ✓    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Create coffee        |   ✗    |   ✗    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Update coffee        |   ✗    |   ✗    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Delete coffee        |   ✗    |   ✗    |    ✗    |    ✓    |   ✓
###
### * Public users only see active coffees from active roasters
### * Members see additional privileged information (costs, detailed stock, etc.)

